WEBVTT

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.820
<i>The Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:46.630
<i>The temperature exceeds 50º
Celsius in the afternoon,</i>

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:50.220
<i>and plummets below freezing at night.</i>

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.130
<i>Here lie the ruins of a
civilization whose transgressions</i>

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:57.800
<i>brought about its downfall centuries prior.</i>

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:03.270
<i>One could even say that they are
grave-posts for those who died here.</i>

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:11.120
<i>As for their surviving descendants...</i>

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:27.600
<i>...they clearly haven't
learned a damn thing.</i>

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:35.780
<i>Honey... - !</i>

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:39.150
<i>Hurry up! We're dead meat if they catch us!</i>

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:41.350
<i>Are you all right, Namiko?!</i>

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:44.890
<i>Mommy... - I'm hungry... - !</i>

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.150
<i>This isn't the time for that... - !</i>

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.330
<i>Honey... - !</i>

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:56.500
<i>Whoa!</i>

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.270
<i>You ain't goin' nowhere!</i>

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:01.870
<i>No! Stop!</i>

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.200
<i>Let Mommy go... - !</i>

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:12.470
<i>Namiko... - !</i>

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.620
<i>Ain't no escape now... - !</i>

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:18.720
<i>Leave everything ya got on the ground!</i>

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:24.120
<i>Not like it matters, we're
gonna rob your corpses anyway!</i>

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:30.290
<i>Oh no! I'm going to be raped!</i>

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:39.570
<i>Damn woman, gettin' our hopes up... - !</i>

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:43.600
<i>- Who'd ever want you?!
- Damn you!</i>

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:48.310
Hey, you from the Kawazu Clan?

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:01.460
<i>- What the... - ?
- You're a puny li'I runt... - !</i>

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:04.900
You the guys who attacked
the oasis transport trucks

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:07.420
at Water Station #45 three days ago?

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:18.880
<i>And what if...</i>

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:21.050
<i>... we are?!</i>

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:24.120
<i>- What if we are?!
- What if we are?!</i>

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:28.350
I've been hired to retrieve
someone's treasure from you.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:33.450
<i>Just so ya know, if you're a
government official then you're dead!</i>

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.620
<i>And you're dead if you're a bounty hunter!</i>

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.420
<i>Let's just say you're dead anyways!</i>

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:53.740
No government official would ever
come somewhere this dangerous-

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:57.010
And all bounty hunters do
is bully weaker people.

00:04:57.010 --> 00:05:01.170
Though it's thanks to them
that jobs come my way...

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:08.480
If you tell me where your
dumbass boss is, I'll let you go.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.630
Did I make you mad?

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:16.960
What a pain...

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:26.770
<i>Think we wasted too much ammo?!</i>

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.330
<i>Look up there!</i>

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.280
<i>W-w-what?! He's flying!</i>

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:37.580
<i>- Is he a ghost?!
- Wait, a ghost... - ?!</i>

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.590
<i>The "Ghost of the Desert"...- ?</i>

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:54.930
<i>Huh... - ?</i>

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:03.900
<i>What the hell did you do to us... - ?</i>

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.550
Tasteless, odorless, and colorless!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:13.490
Super instant paralysis spray!
Works good, huh?

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:18.460
<i>That ain't fair...</i>

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:23.200
I'm known far and wide for
always carrying out my jobs.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:26.390
I don't want to lose that reputation...

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:28.930
... so I'll do anything.

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:31.710
Now tell me where your hideout is!

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:34.570
- Take this! And this!
- You're so mean!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.080
57, 58, 59, 60...

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:45.950
Well, then,

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:50.760
You sure were lucky to be
saved for only 200,000 a head.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:51.490
See ya.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.730
<i>Honey... - !</i>

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:02.070
<i>Forgive me for being so weak... - !</i>

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:04.590
<i>I can't say no to a ghost... - !</i>

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:07.570
<i>Honey... - !</i>

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:17.920
<i>Eh? Masami's group is missing?</i>

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:19.990
<i>We can't get 'em on the radio, either...</i>

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:23.650
<i>They were supposed to be
in charge of West 33 today...</i>

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.700
<i>They're probably off
having "fun" elsewhere-</i>

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:36.040
<i>Well, they can just forget about
their after-dinner pudding!</i>

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:38.340
<i>Yes sir! I'll give them a talking to!</i>

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:41.440
<i>- No pudding, no pudding!
- No pudding, no pudding!</i>

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.750
<i>I will eat their pudding.</i>

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.710
<i>"Kawazu Clan Boss - Kawazu Makoto, Age 37"</i>

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:50.280
<i>Pudding, pudding! My dear pudding!</i>

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:52.910
<i>Yummy!</i>

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.920
<i>Bad news!</i>

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:59.730
<i>- What's wrong?!
- There was a letter at the entrance... - !</i>

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.820
<i>It's a letter from the Sunabouzu!</i>

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.900
<i>Sunabouzu?</i>

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:14.780
<i>That handyman who's been
crushing various clans lately</i>

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:17.340
<i>with his strange "magic"?</i>

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.750
<i>Sounds interesting; Read it.</i>

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.350
<i>Yes, sir... - !</i>

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:24.580
"Dear Loser Kawazu Boss... - "

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:28.090
"I've come for your head. Fight me!"

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:32.690
"There's no point running,
'cause I'm gonna kill your sorry ass"

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:35.260
"I also took care of your
three loser henchmen"

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:39.720
"See you soon, Idiot Boss
of the Moron Clan."

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:41.260
<i>Eep...</i>

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:48.080
<i>Whoa, even after all that trash talk...</i>

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.540
<i>...he's not upset one bit...</i>

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:53.910
<i>- Talk about cool...
- That's our boss!</i>

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:58.580
"P.S. Your mommy has an outie!"

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.250
<i>Mommy does not have an outie... - !</i>

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:07.530
<i>The boss is mad!</i>

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:09.760
<i>- His Hulkosis... - !
- Run... - !</i>

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:30.780
None of my business.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:37.590
Fine, whatever.

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:40.720
Ok, now... - !

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:45.220
A babe!

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:48.330
With boobs!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:54.740
Are you all right, Miss?! Allow me to...

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.410
Aah!

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:15.260
<i>"Handy"</i>

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:21.430
<i>I'm sorry. I thought you were a bandit...</i>

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.280
B-but what are you doing out here... - ?

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:34.250
In those sexy, I mean, light clothes,

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:37.610
you'll develop heatstroke and
blisters in half a day... - !

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:43.280
<i>Actually... - I'm... - !</i>

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:46.290
<i>I'm... - !</i>

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:52.500
<i>Please save me!</i>

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.400
Save you? From what... - ?

00:10:55.400 --> 00:11:00.910
<i>That awful, vicious Kawazu
Clan forced me to go with them,</i>

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:03.280
<i>but I just managed to escape... - !</i>

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.570
<i>Hey, there!</i>

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.710
Forced?!

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:11.420
<i>Their boss told me I was going to
make pudding for the rest of my life</i>

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.850
<i>in his mom's place...</i>

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.490
<i>Isn't that just horrible?</i>

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:17.290
Forced? To do what, exactly?!

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:21.090
<i>- Forced? To do what, exactly?!
- But I guess I'm just too cute, so...</i>

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.760
<i>Please! You're my only hope!</i>

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.570
Don't cry, Milady.

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:31.240
I, too, have some business
with the Kawazu Clan.

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:35.110
Once I'm done, I shall
accompany you to an oasis.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:40.750
<i>Come to think of it, they did
say they lost some guards...</i>

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:42.320
<i>Does that mean you're...</i>

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:44.280
Damn, I've been found out...

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.190
What's wrong, Madam?!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:56.090
<i>I suddenly feel weak
now that I feel safe...</i>

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:03.000
This girl desperately
needs me right now!

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.830
She completely depends on me!

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.900
She can't live without me!

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:16.810
You're gonna pay, Kawazu Clan!

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:23.590
By the way, is the Kawazu
hideout around here?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:24.320
<i>Right over there.</i>

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.490
<i>"Signpost"</i>

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:29.820
Whoa. Now that's obvious...

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.120
<i>Yes...</i>

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.740
There ain't anything here...

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:50.120
<i>- That's the Sunabouzu?
- Pretty puny if you ask me...</i>

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.110
<i>You idiot! Don't let your guard down!
He's the Ghost of the Desert!</i>

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:58.090
<i>What're you so scared about?</i>

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.560
<i>I'll take him down with one shot... - !</i>

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.460
<i>Huh?! He's looking this way!</i>

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.950
<i>You moron! Just shoot already!</i>

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.680
<i>That ain't ordinary shotgun ammo!</i>

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.140
<i>Them's grenades!</i>

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:24.220
These bums are 100 years
too early to ambush me

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:25.910
without any real equipment!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.430
<i>Don't let him escape! Fire! Fire!</i>

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:41.730
<i>Take this! And this! And this!</i>

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:44.360
Crap!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:48.230
<i>Fire! Fire!</i>

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.450
Whew, I'm pooped...

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:57.250
Now what? I used too much ammo... -

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:00.850
Oh well, I can just add it to the bill... - !

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:10.660
You guys're annoying! Eat this!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.960
<i>There's only one of him! Get him!</i>

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:20.130
Crap... - I better retreat for now... - !

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:25.410
<i>The dumbass ran in there!</i>

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:27.710
<i>Trap him like a rat!</i>

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.240
<i>What's that... - ?!</i>

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.340
<i>Crap!</i>

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:38.730
Morons!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:39.890
<i>Pretty good!</i>

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:47.200
<i>But not as good as the
rumors say, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:53.260
<i>You're one helluva moron to call
us out here and fall into our trap!</i>

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.840
That's one ugly mug!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:15:01.410
He must lead a tough life. Hulkosis, huh...

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:02.810
Called you out here?!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:08.320
- You the Kawazu Boss?
- Indeed!

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:11.930
I came to get the treasure
around your neck,

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:15.760
but I've suddenly decided to
crush the lot of you as well.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.530
<i>Are you insane?! How do you expect
to get outta this situation?!</i>

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.970
<i>Just go ahead and try it!</i>

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:24.200
<i>How dare you kill Masami and the others!</i>

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:27.670
<i>Don't expect to die peacefully!</i>

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:30.580
That three-man squad? I didn't kill 'em.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.740
I tied 'em up and tossed
'em in some building.

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:40.020
<i>Mommy does not have an outie!</i>

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:40.720
Huh?!

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:44.290
<i>Bastard! Trying to play dumb?!</i>

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.830
<i>You can't lie after sending
that letter, dumbass!</i>

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:52.770
Dumbass? I got no idea what
you're talking about... - !

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.290
I've had enough of this... - !

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.660
<i>- A smokescreen!
- Kill him!</i>

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:14.690
<i>Alright! That's enough-
Bring his carcass here-</i>

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:16.780
<i>Huh... - ?</i>

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:22.330
<i>- He ain't anywhere!
- Look harder!</i>

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.350
<i>He got blasted to smithereens-</i>

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:29.800
<i>Damn... - !</i>

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.340
<i>Look up there!</i>

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:37.070
<i>The dude's flying!</i>

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:39.370
<i>He is a ghost!</i>

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:43.050
<i>- There's more of him!
- Ghosts!</i>

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:48.010
<i>There are no such things as ghosts!</i>

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.740
<i>Blew him clean away!</i>

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:12.300
<i>What's that?!</i>

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:34.460
<i>Boss! Look!</i>

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:41.400
Your mommy has an outie!
Your mommy has an outie!

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:49.280
<i>My...</i>

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:51.580
<i>My mommy does not have an outie!</i>

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:58.420
Your mommy has an outie!

00:17:58.420 --> 00:17:59.560
<i>She does not...</i>

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:00.930
Your mommy has an outie!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.230
<i>- Have an outie!</i>

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:03.400
Your mommy has an outie!

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:04.730
<i>You got that?!</i>

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.500
Your mommy has an outie!

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:11.540
<i>Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!</i>

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:17.440
<i>Damn you! Damn you! You got that?!
So shut the hell up!</i>

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:44.730
Do you know why they call me the Sunabouzu?

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:49.440
<i>Mommy does not have an outie...</i>

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:00.210
<i>A balloon... - ?</i>

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:25.410
<i>- The boss... - !
- He lost... - !</i>

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:28.780
<i>- How did he fly like that... - ?
- That was spooky...</i>

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:31.580
<i>No human can do that... - !</i>

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:35.710
<i>- He's a ghost!
- The Ghost of the Desert - the Sunabouzu!</i>

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.320
Piece of cake...

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:01.910
Huh? Oh, Boobie Lady... - !

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:07.620
<i>You're pretty good! I got a nice,
good look at how you work!</i>

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:10.520
You're too kind... - !

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:13.060
<i>I'm here to get this too, you see.</i>

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.060
Eh?!

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.800
<i>My client is the same as yours, of course.</i>

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:22.540
<i>It's nothing that great, but I
guess it's really important to him</i>

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:27.100
<i>because he's been throwing lots
of money around to get it back!</i>

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:31.870
Don't tell me that huge explosion was...

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.370
<i>Yep. That was me.</i>

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:40.950
<i>I figured having the famous
Sunabouzu-san and the Kawazu Clan</i>

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:44.790
<i>stamp each other out first
would be the easiest way...</i>

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:52.220
<i>I'm Asagiri Junko.
I'll do anything for money.</i>

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:55.540
Hey, wait... - !

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:59.490
<i>I expect to be your rival from
now on, so I'll see you around!</i>

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.460
Don't tell me I've been tricked?!

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:19.530
Not me!

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:21.760
That's so totally uncool!

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.630
<i>The Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:31.540
<i>In this hellish desert, man,
the most violent and powerful creature</i>

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:35.060
<i>in the history of the earth...</i>

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:42.380
Asagiri Junko! Just you watch!
I will get it back... - !

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:49.590
You will pay for crushing
a man's pure heart!

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:51.790
Don't think you've won!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:57.250
I'm known far and wide for
always carrying out my jobs!

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:07.960
<i>...continues to thrive to this
day, bursting with avarice.</i>

00:22:09.710 --> 00:22:14.110
Wonder what I should do
when I catch that wench... - ?!

00:22:14.110 --> 00:22:20.150
I could do all kinds of things
with those humongous boobies... - !

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:22.310
I'm coming for you!

00:22:23.090 --> 00:22:25.060
